[en.FOCUS_C01_EDUCATION_REFORM]
Education Reform

[en.FOCUS_C01_EDUCATION_REFORM_desc]
Through reforming education, we can improve the political stability of the empire, cultivate more loyal citizens, and develop imperial science and magic industries at once.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_EDUCATION_REFORM]
教育改革

[zh.FOCUS_C01_EDUCATION_REFORM_desc]
通过改革教育，在提高帝国政治稳定性的同时，培养更多的忠诚公民，发展帝国科学与魔法工业。

